impactapi.config.client.hologram.maxCoexisting=Max Coexisting Holograms
impactapi.config.client.hologram.maxCoexisting.tooltip=Number of holograms that can coexist. Usually all hints generated by one right click belongs to one hologram. An attempt will be made to prune old holograms when a new hologram is about to be projected and this limit would be exceeded.
